{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Limit Break is a game that allows you to play four games at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game was inspired by watching a professional gamer play multiple games at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What you need for this game is quickness, judgment, and extreme multitasking ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is designed to challenge people's limits. Break through your limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Composition</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It consists of matching mushroom colors, avoiding lasers, filling pancakes, and jumping games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623580/extras/d64720c1b18e51692148a8efeee512bc.avif?t=1752902710\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How To Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The mushroom color matching game can be played with left and right arrows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The laser avoidance game can be played with W, A, S, and D keys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pancake games can be played with a space bar key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The jump game is playable with the up arrow.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3623580?t=1752902710","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3623580?t=1752902710","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623580/38be4437b63a5bb2a1e915d7b971734302c2fa6a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752902710","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623580/38be4437b63a5bb2a1e915d7b971734302c2fa6a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752902710","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description